# Scarcity Isle (#2750): the wish bank (bank/, the WishCharge hook the level jar fills). Every wish counts: a new
# player starts with 10, and a ready-made make costs half of one.
@intent the Isle's wish bank shows a new player's wishes and charges a ready-made make half a wish
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat How to use Moddy within 90s
@repeat 30 until execute if entity @s[y=60,dy=12]
@wait 1s
@end-repeat

@step a full bank
moddy wishes
@expect chat Your wishes: 10/10 within 10s

@step a ready-made make costs half a wish
moddy apprentice a stack of oak logs
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@repeat 20 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:oak_log
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@wait 2s
moddy wishes
@expect chat /Your wishes: 9½\/10/ within 10s
